<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Facet Lance</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Facet Lance</ansi> is used by the Watching Obelisk. One of its faces turns slowly
toward a single target and throws a narrow beam of cold light at them. It
is quick, and the Obelisk uses it between its greater workings.

